  "notes": "The Stinkyscape+ set ships (R1420), gated for the AI's decks (R1390); every random card an effect makes is unique until its pool runs out (R3563000); xxFreshJack and Shockwave447 read lists the set grows (R2173001); Transmogulate and Bob's Plan draw through the tally",
